<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") -%>
	<div class="container">
		<h3 class="text-center">Campus Book Drop is dedicated to assisting college students in effortlessly selling their used textbooks.</h3>
	</div>
	<div class="container-fluid my-5">
		<div class="p-5 text-center bg-body-tertiary rounded-3">
			<div class="fs-5">
				<p>
					Campus Book Drop is your one-stop shop for quality used books! We were founded
					by not particularly a book lover who, frankly, was too lazy to go out and sell his used books in
					person.
				</p>
				<p>
					So, he decided to create an
					online marketplace where he could sell his books from the comfort of his own place. And thus, Campus
					Book Drop was born!
				</p>
				<p>Our mission is to make buying and selling used books as easy and convenient as possible.
					We know that there are
					a lot of used book enthusiasts out there who don't have the time or energy to go to physical
					bookstores
					or flea markets to find what they're looking for. That's where we come in. Our online store is open
					24/7, so
					you can buy and sell books at your leisure
				</p>
				<p>
					We understand the financial challenges that students face, and our goal is
					to
					help them save money by connecting them with affordable textbooks. 
				</p>
				<p>
					This website exists to create a
					community where students can easily find the books they need and connect with fellow students who
					are
					looking to sell their used books. Our aim is to make the book buying and selling process more
					accessible, cost-effective, and efficient for college students.
				</p>
				<p>Currently we are only serving only select hostels in MNNIT Allhabad Campus, if you want
					us to expand our reach
					<a href="/join_us">Join Us!</a>
				</p>
				<p>Thank you for choosing Campus Book Drop for all of book needs. Happy reading!

				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container my-5">
		<div class="p-5 position-relative text-center text-muted bg-body border border-dashed rounded-5">
			<h1 class="text-body-emphasis">Meet the Founder: Me!</h1>
			<p class="fs-5">
				Connect with me: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ankur-singh-82496514b">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor"
						class="bi bi-linkedin" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
						<path
							d="M0 1.146C0 .513.526 0 1.175 0h13.65C15.474 0 16 .513 16 1.146v13.708c0 .633-.526 1.146-1.175 1.146H1.175C.526 16 0 15.487 0 14.854V1.146zm4.943 12.248V6.169H2.542v7.225h2.401zm-1.2-8.212c.837 0 1.358-.554 1.358-1.248-.015-.709-.52-1.248-1.342-1.248-.822 0-1.359.54-1.359 1.248 0 .694.521 1.248 1.327 1.248h.016zm4.908 8.212V9.359c0-.216.016-.432.08-.586.173-.431.568-.878 1.232-.878.869 0 1.216.662 1.216 1.634v3.865h2.401V9.25c0-2.22-1.184-3.252-2.764-3.252-1.274 0-1.845.7-2.165 1.193v.025h-.016a5.54 5.54 0 0 1 .016-.025V6.169h-2.4c.03.678 0 7.225 0 7.225h2.4z" />
					</svg>
				</a>
			</p>
			<div class="mb-4 fs-5">
				<p>
					As the sole developer of this website, my initial focus was on its
					functionality and later on improving its visual appeal. I am currently working on enhancing the
					styles
					and design elements to create a more polished look.
				</p>
				<p>
					However, I understand that there might be areas where the styling can be further improved. Your
					valuable
					suggestions and recommendations for enhancing the overall aesthetics are greatly appreciated. I
					welcome
					any feedback or ideas you may have to make the website more visually appealing and user-friendly.
				<p class="fw-bold">If you encounter any bugs or issues while using the website, please don't hesitate to
					contact me. Your feedback is valuable in helping me improve the user experience, and I'll make sure
					to
					address any problems as quickly as possible. Thank you for your assistance in making the website
					better
					for everyone!</p>
				</p>
				<p>
					Additionally, since I am managing all aspects of the website on my own, I am open to assistance and
					collaboration. If you have expertise or skills that could contribute to improving different aspects
					of
					the website, I would be grateful for your support and involvement.
				</p>
				<p>
					Together, we can create a better experience for our users and continue to enhance the functionality
					and
					aesthetics of the website. Your input and assistance are highly valued and appreciated.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container-fluid my-5">
		<div class="p-5 text-center bg-body-tertiary rounded-3">
			<div class="fs-5">
				<p>
					Although I developed and manage this website on my own, you may notice that I often use "we" and "our"
					throughout the website. This is intentional and stems from my vision for the future growth of this
					platform.
				</p>
				<p>
					While it may currently be a one-person operation, I firmly believe in the potential and scalability of
					this website. By using inclusive language like "we" and "our," I aim to create a sense of community and
					invite others to join me on this journey.
				</p>
				<p>
					I envision a future where this platform expands, more users and contributors come on board, and the
					community grows stronger. Together, we can shape the future of this website, offer better services, and
					create a thriving marketplace for college students to buy and sell their used books.
				</p>
				<p>
					So, when you come across "we" and "our" on this website, know that it represents not just my efforts but
					also the potential and possibilities that lie ahead. I invite you to be part of this vision and
					contribute to the growth and success of our community.
				</p>
				<p>
	
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>